<title>DUBAI: National Bank of Dubai lifts 96 net, div flat.</title>
<headline>National Bank of Dubai lifts 96 net, div flat.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million UAE dirhams unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit for the year	363.40	  vs     352.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax			    363.56	  vs     351.39</p>
<p> Net interest income	    464.78	  vs     452.77</p>
<p> Other income			64.35	  vs	53.77</p>
<p> Provisions, other expenses    22.78	  vs	18.64</p>
<p> Proposed cash dividend	 344.71	  vs	same</p>
<p>Full Name: The National Bank of Dubai.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom  9714-626990</p>
</text>
